{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":25784,\"title\":\"Journey from the Fall\",\"tagline\":\"Vietnam, 1975. The untold story of their fight for freedom.\",\"overview\":\"Thirteen years after the end of the Vietnam War, a family who was tragically affected by the war are forced to emigrate to America.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/20QLLHVKEkkABlRf17e9jWYcibe.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nPLfsTwfXlqHhwyFeFrlAGyXetR.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":11,\"year\":2007,\"runtime\":135,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":1300000,\"revenue\":639000,\"director\":\"Ham Tran\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":143430,\"name\":\"Ham Tran\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ldh3eaY0iOtxMednvzgcm09wdGX.jpg\"},{\"id\":143432,\"name\":\"Kieu Chinh\",\"character\":\"Ba Noi (Grandmother)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8cma5eMGXLc9ED9DMYfMCmjteVp.jpg\"},{\"id\":111185,\"name\":\"Long Nguyen\",\"character\":\"Long\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c47F79zg0QreGz2wZ4b78lIZC9M.jpg\"},{\"id\":143433,\"name\":\"Diem Lien\",\"character\":\"Mai\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":143434,\"name\":\"Mai Thế Hiệp\",\"character\":\"Thanh\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8dqjqBlYB3JGtzvEASfs9d3zcDM.jpg\"},{\"id\":143435,\"name\":\"Khanh Doan\",\"character\":\"Nam\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":81194,\"name\":\"Cat Ly\",\"character\":\"Phuong\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ljhx7N0ndkVlArHlHbgcij3fvxk.jpg\"},{\"id\":143436,\"name\":\"Nguyen Thai Nguyen\",\"character\":\"Lai\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1542133,\"name\":\"Tere Morris\",\"character\":\"Miss Patty\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2675933,\"name\":\"Lam Ngoc Nguyen\",\"character\":\"Khanh\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ptiWt235UZTr6aHmepgN4LXK4KU.jpg\"},{\"id\":1826561,\"name\":\"Jacquie Nguyen\",\"character\":\"Granddaughter On Boat (as Thuy Nguyen)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dGdpmRhUNXpC8X6mJ1nLx6g8ig9.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":4982,\"title\":\"American Gangster\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sX9idXDqRUxE5ffww3n3RV5gL55.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dLL90vskYFn1S89RZp5TUguK9wl.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Loosely based on the criminal career of Frank Lucas, a gangster from La Grange, North Carolina, who smuggled heroin into the United States on American service planes returning from the Vietnam War, before being detained by a task force led by Newark Detective Richie Roberts.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":581859,\"title\":\"Da 5 Bloods\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yx4cp1ljJMDSFeEex0Zjv45b55E.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Aq5Zhj9iaTF6BEKNk05dlUxeHKa.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Four African-American Vietnam veterans return to Vietnam. They are in search of the remains of their fallen squad leader and the promise of buried treasure. These heroes battle forces of humanity and nature while confronted by the lasting ravages of the immorality of the Vietnam War.\",\"genres\":[\"War\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":567973,\"title\":\"Furie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6LON0M5qfRb8M2XqKnUvOpCBq3Z.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jXc41btarmyCRM9WMDzJ4b0zpRW.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a little girl is kidnapped by a trafficking ring, they soon find they messed with the wrong child. Her mother, a notorious former gang leader, is close on their trail and will go to any lengths to bring her child home.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22132,\"title\":\"Mo\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wRAi5oi10Z9rBT5CRWPIebiBE84.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Every kid wants to be cool and fit in - life's a blast even when you're different. When Mo's reflection is revealed, he sees a body that doesn't quite resemble any of his peers. Here, he tells the tale of his youth, growing up on the south shore of Long Island, New York\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":25461,\"title\":\"Raising Victor Vargas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cMHMtMBca8VNxjYICc1WHK1Qqe5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zI2dRzIeRJtNwUalLTSg5OBmY4o.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Victor, a Lower East Side teenager, as he deals with his eccentric family, including his strict grandmother, his bratty sister, and a younger brother who completely idolizes him. Along the way he tries to win the affections of Judy, who is very careful and calculating when it comes to how she deals with men.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":25025,\"title\":\"Septem8er Tapes\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/t0RsC7ooj1QslzmP8dy34X7ES4m.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mc7hwNzosWl4U8xus8d73PYEgAF.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"One year after 9/11, an American journalist travels to Afghanistan in an effort to learn the truth about the search for Osama bin Laden.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22200,\"title\":\"Once Upon a Time in the Midlands\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z4w08dm44L650QCegJQML4AyFTJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hD4Ok3fWe9gpGQlunPcCOO79Hlq.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Though Dek leads a simple and happy life with his girlfriend Shirley and her 12-year-old daughter Marlene, his grand, televised marriage proposal puts his devotion to the test—especially as Marlene's long-absent biological father, Jimmy, looms in the background.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":23516,\"title\":\"Frownland\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2hHg1HNV7vIOJ3gsuGYzAjDP5ph.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sijyf7g2plbKAEMamDS6gs2Wydh.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Keith is a disturbingly maladjusted social outcast and self-described “troll” whose neuroses plunge him into an unstoppable spiral of self-obliteration as his crummy coupon-selling job, pitiful living situation and last remaining human relationships disintegrate around him.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":25128,\"title\":\"Love & Sex\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x4pnZxarc6VbkSv19Rfoio4yNmW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jN7CC157HPiKm130DlkJ3IITjSm.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When her rather explicit copy is rejected, magazine journalist Kate is asked by her editor to come up with an article on loving relationships instead, and to do so by the end of the day. This gets Kate thinking back over her own various experiences, and to wondering if she is in much of a position to write on the subject.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":40769,\"title\":\"Mutual Appreciation\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yjKHIcFue6Et3qsBbxcVUrGjGRM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nbWnSvZNuxYQyebD7OHJAuyJuBe.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Alan is a musician who leaves a busted-up band for New York, and a new musical voyage. He tries to stay focused and fends off all manner of distractions, including the attraction to his good friend's girlfriend.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":40759,\"title\":\"Karma Police\",\"poster\":null,\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"What if a worldwide secret organization existed and you were recruited to join? That's what happens to Charles West when he's recruited to join the Karma Police. He loves it...but is making sure that good people are rewarded and bad people punished all that it seems to be?\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":25216,\"title\":\"Steel City\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wSrm5hrbkMfYaYpKoS8zDzqUuOy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a tragic accident caused by the truck of the middle-aged Carl Lee where a woman dies with a crushed stern, he is arrested and sent to the county jail. His son PJ, who works washing dishes and cleaning tables in a restaurant, feels lost, without financial support to keep his father's house, and is fired from his job and evicted from his house.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"e84lOfQH0FM\",\"name\":\"Official Journey from the Fall Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}